{"id":786502,"title":"01｜人工智能的发展阶段","content":"人工智能的发展分为四个阶段。第一阶段是使用工具，如Word、PPT和Photoshop，所有工作由人工完成。第二阶段引入了聊天机器人，如ChatGPT，可以辅助生成文案、图片和代码片段，但不能直接完成任务。第三阶段称为copilot，即副驾驶模式，人工智能成为合作伙伴，例如在设计PPT或编写代码时自动补全部分内容，但仍需与人工协同完成最终工作。第四阶段是智能体阶段，人类仅负责设定目标和提供资源，智能体则自主完成所有任务，并将结果反馈给人类进行监督。以智能客服为例，它能自动沟通、收集信息、判断购买意向并通知销售团队，整个过程无需人工干预。智能体代表了未来发展方向。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":392350,"user_name":"Twein","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1309882,"ip_address":"海南","ucode":"83498605A39292","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1G2rlRgNalXbcUnHibRNMibAeHQhWoKNl4e4EgkiawDynZZiaO4W3vSSMtlYEKrt6e7GW4mcu1sjcs7bGKjl0vRhWQ/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1720665595,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":142610,"content":"课程详情页有～","user_name":"编辑回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":2852467,"ctime":1720714533,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":392350,"utype":2}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"实践操作手册在哪里下载","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":2852467,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/2b/86/73/5190bbde.jpg","nickname":"苏果果","note":"","ucode":"12A62ED032F345","race_medal":1,"user_type":8,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":647884,"discussion_content":"课程详情页有～","content_length":7,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1720714533,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":8,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":391966,"user_name":"徐","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1035885,"ip_address":"湖南","ucode":"D8FA8A64FB7E33","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/ce/6d/530df0dd.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1719